CC0 1.0 Universal

The catalog metadata in this repository (the JSON artifacts, the Python catalog
definitions, the schemas and the documentation) is dedicated to the public
domain under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal dedication.

Full text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

This dedication does NOT extend to the underlying data described by the
catalog. Every data source keeps its own licence and terms, which are recorded
per source in sources/source-directory.json and summarised in
sources/licensing.json. Some sources prohibit commercial use, require
attribution, or forbid redistribution; those terms govern any downstream use of
their data.

The catalog is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. Verification
results are reachability snapshots, not legal clearance.
